{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>You multiplied</b> — Until now: your merchants multiplied, like סוחריך (your traders); close to it: ולא תלך רכיל (and you shall not go about as a talebearer), and all of them shall be like the ילק (locust) that spreads over the land." "<b>and flew away</b> — And it was not seen."], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:43.645792031Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}